SECTION 3: ARCHITECTURAL ATTRIBUTION & ZERO-DEPENDENCY RUNTIME
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
lh-logimail-engine is intentionally architected with 100% zero external runtime
dependencies. It operates exclusively upon native PHP 8.2+ core functionality and
standard system extensions:

1. PHP Standard Library (SPL)
   - License: PHP License v3.01
   - Copyright (c) 1999-2026 The PHP Group

2. ext-openssl (OpenSSL Cryptographic Extension)
   - Cryptographic primitives for RSA-SHA256 DKIM signing & TLS v1.2/v1.3 negotiation
   - Underlying OpenSSL library: Apache License 2.0 / OpenSSL License

3. ext-json (JSON Serialization & Parsing)
   - License: PHP License v3.01
   - Canonical JSON export and configuration auditing

SECTION 4: STANDARDS & SPECIFICATIONS ACKNOWLEDGMENT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This software incorporates logic and rules adhering strictly to official open
industry standards and specifications:

1. RFC 5322 - Internet Message Format (IETF)
2. RFC 6376 - DomainKeys Identified Mail (DKIM) Signatures (IETF)
3. RFC 2045 / RFC 2046 - Multipurpose Internet Mail Extensions (MIME) (IETF)
4. RFC 8058 - Signaling One-Click Functionality for List-Unsubscribe (IETF)
5. RFC 7208 - Sender Policy Framework (SPF) for Authorizing Use of Domains in Email
6. RFC 7489 - Domain-based Message Authentication, Reporting, and Conformance (DMARC)
7. OASIS Static Analysis Results Interchange Format (SARIF) v2.1.0
8. MITRE Common Weakness Enumeration (CWE) List

